{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号文字，首先被薄荷绿高亮的“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”吸引，随后注意到“沉默也很舒服，心却慢慢漂远”。下方第二块大字也比较显眼。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"正处在与另一个人亲近、安静相处的时刻。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松，但内心有些游离，心思慢慢远去。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实很想表达自己有多喜欢这种状态，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，却没想好怎么开口，念头逐渐淡去。下方小字中的声音变化和思绪细节也不容易第一眼获取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方和下方两块大号文字都比较显眼，存在一定的主视线竞争。\",\n    \"上方主句较长，一块里包含亲近、声音退去、身体放松、沉默舒适、内心漂远等多个层次。\",\n    \"下方小字连续堆叠，需要挑选多条信息才能理解具体的声音和思绪变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3a3a1847-3b0b-4bcc-a4ad-a21fbb155128", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011452109211Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:15:33.779264+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3d110fbe6159ec5c81cf248324358ddeaa9a232aa070feab5c4a07c4cad60f63", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4